## Research Highlights
Bimetallic FeTb-MOFs obtained by using the MOF-on-MOF strategy;   
Novel platform for the CA 125 RNA aptamer immobilization, detection of CA 125 and living cancer cells;   
Excellent biocompatibility, good endocytosis, and strong fluorescence of Tb-MOF-on-Fe-MOF;   
Ultra-low detection limit and other sensing performances.
